ServerSignature Off
Options -Indexes -ExecCGI -Includes
DirectoryIndex disabled
ErrorDocument 404 /404.html
# BEGIN Cloudflare-only origin
# PROXY_REMOTE_ADDR is set internally by LiteSpeed when it restores a visitor IP.
# Never use an HTTP header to decide whether the connection is allowed.
